Ring o' Conflict behavior spoiler:

Wearing a RoC will force all creatures adjacent to each other to fight
to the death while you stand back and watch.  When there's one monster
left, you can then kill it off.  The RoC is a very useful tool when you're
a low level character but it makes the castle, wizard and his pets, and
end-level play too easy (IMHO).
